[Music]  seven kingdoms is a single realm  made up of seven realms that once were  independent kings landing it's the  capital city of this world  it is a place where there is  extravagance and wealth  and decadence lannisters are the  wealthiest family in westeros and have  been for centuries  each of the houses has their heroic  symbol for the lannisters it's a lion  red is the lannister color cersei  lannister is the queen  she was married to the king and  essentially an arranged marriage in  order to keep the kingdoms together  after rebellion it's not a damn  joust before i pissed myself i believe  that cersei really loved robert in the  beginning and thought  that they could make it work but you  know on their wedding night he calls out  another name from then on  i think she's pretty wounded she's very  politically minded  and very aware of power  for her the the highest morality is  protect the family  someday you'll sit on the throne and the  truth will be what you make it  jamie her twin brother is one of the  members of the kingsguard  an elite order of knights their duty is  to  guard the king at all times jamie is  called the king slayer  because he was actually previously a  member of kingsguard for the last  targaryen king  and he actually killed the king that he  had sworn to protect  what did the mad king say when you  stabbed him in the back  he is considered not quite trustworthy  cersei and jaime the twins have another  brother  tyrion lannister tyrion is a dwarf he's  younger than his two siblings he enjoys  playing with people's expectations of  him he's had a very complicated  upbringing  in relation to his father being a dwarf  and all that that's in the medieval  times that was considered  a judgment of the gods word's probably  gotten to my father by now  he'll be offering a handsome reward  everyone knows  lannister always pays his debts it's  just a little  reminder to the people in this world who  are constantly stabbing each other in  t